# /ticket - implement a ticket end to end

Input: a ticket reference ({{KEY_EXAMPLE}} or URL). Optional: `--worktree` (parallel work), `--no-pr` (stop before PR).

Output: verified change on a branch with an open PR, ticket advanced to {{REVIEW_STATE}}, honest report.

The ticket is the only input you need; everything else is in `CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/rules/`, and `llm/`. If auth below fails, print the fix and stop rather than half-running.

## 1. Fetch

{{FETCH_COMMANDS}}
